{
  "episode_id": "2026-08-05",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友们大家好，欢迎收听AI每日先锋，今天是2026年8月5日星期三。我是苏晴，坐在我旁边的依然是那位永远在电脑前盯盘的男人，周航。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 19.306,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_001_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你好大家好，我是周航。你说我盯盘也行，但今天这几条新闻确实值得盯一盯。",
      "start": 20.755,
      "duration": 6.226,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，今天这期内容我看到大纲的时候就觉得特别有质感。一个讲AI怎么帮科学家干活，另一个讲AI怎么帮老板省钱，主题正好踩在咱们一直念叨的那个趋势上。",
      "start": 27.478,
      "duration": 15.63,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你观察得很准。说白了，现在AI竞争的焦点早就不是\"谁的模型分数高\"了，而是谁的生态铺得开、谁的成本压得低。今天这两条头条正好一软一硬，把这个趋势给串起来了。",
      "start": 43.561,
      "duration": 15.649,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那咱们先说第一条。北大联合元空AI实验室搞了一个开源科研智能体，据说零依赖、MIT协议，还内置了30多项科研技能。我第一反应是——这是不是又一个蹭热点的开源项目？",
      "start": 59.615,
      "duration": 19.872,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "还真不是。你注意啊，这个东西对标的其实是Anthropic那个Science功能，是闭源的、要付费的，普通实验室想用门槛很高。现在北大的团队直接把它开源了，而且MIT协议意味着你拿去商用都没人管你。",
      "start": 79.92,
      "duration": 22.398,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个区别挺关键的。MIT协议是那种很宽松的对吧？基本上就是\"拿去吧，随便用\"。",
      "start": 102.783,
      "duration": 9.23,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，比Apache还宽松，连署名要求都很少。这种协议对开发者特别友好，相当于直接把工具送到中小实验室和独立研究者手里。",
      "start": 112.475,
      "duration": 10.318,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我就在想一个问题，这30多项Skills具体能干嘛呀？是那种帮你查文献的，还是真的能跑实验设计？",
      "start": 123.244,
      "duration": 9.012,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "涵盖面挺广的，从文献检索、数据清洗、代码生成到一些常见的科研流程编排都有。说白了，它不是那种只会聊天的Chatbot，而是一个真正能接入你工作流的Agent。你想想，以前一个博士生光是处理数据就得折腾好几天，现在可能半小时就给你跑完了。",
      "start": 132.756,
      "duration": 24.052,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太香了吧。但我有个担心，这种科研智能体开源出来，会不会反而被一些公司拿去包装一下就当成自己的产品卖？",
      "start": 157.246,
      "duration": 10.318,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这事儿在开源圈太常见了。你看Linux当年不也被各种厂商打包嘛。但问题在于，这个领域的核心不是代码本身，而是科研know-how和Skills的设计。你就算fork了代码，没有那30多项能力的沉淀，你做出来的东西就是个壳。所以长远看，真正受益的还是那些愿意深耕科研工作流的团队。",
      "start": 168.025,
      "duration": 24.855,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说得有道理。开源生态对闭源工具的冲击这事我觉得是必然的，就像当年Linux对Windows Server的冲击一样，先渗透边缘，再慢慢蚕食主流。",
      "start": 193.325,
      "duration": 12.713,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且你注意一个细节，\"AI for Science\"这四个字以前基本是大厂的游戏，因为算力和数据门槛太高。现在基础设施平民化了，意味着科研的权力格局会发生变化。以前一个实验室能不能出成果，很大程度上取决于能不能买到顶级的工具；以后可能就取决于你会不会用这些Agent。",
      "start": 206.512,
      "duration": 25.01,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个变化挺深远的。好了，咱们说说第二条，这个听起来更刺激一点——亿级日活的App怎么靠跨云架构砍掉75%的GPU集群？",
      "start": 231.949,
      "duration": 13.497,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个案例我反复看了几遍，确实有点东西。出海AI应用现在被三重锁链捆着：单一云厂商依赖、推理成本倒挂、还有区域资源不均。什么叫成本倒挂呢？就是用户增长越快，你亏得越多，因为每次推理都要给云厂商交钱。",
      "start": 245.91,
      "duration": 21.178,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个我懂。之前咱们聊过，AI产品的边际成本不是零，而是每次对话都要烧钱。当DAU冲到亿级，这笔账就吓人了。",
      "start": 267.505,
      "duration": 9.622,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。这家团队的解法是做跨云架构，简单说就是不把鸡蛋放一个篮子里。他们会根据不同区域的电价、GPU空闲率、还有网络延迟，动态调度推理任务。结果就是GPU集群直接砍掉75%，但服务能力反而没下降。",
      "start": 277.563,
      "duration": 18.305,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说这个数字太猛了。75%意味着什么？意味着同样一笔钱，以前只能服务一亿用户，现在能服务四亿。",
      "start": 296.285,
      "duration": 8.751,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错。这就是为啥我说今天的金句特别到位。当模型能力趋同的时候，竞争早就不是\"谁的模型更聪明\"，而是\"谁能把单位推理成本压到极限\"。这个案子的价值不在于技术多炫，而在于它证明了——AI基础设施的服务范式正在被重新定义。",
      "start": 305.532,
      "duration": 20.806,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说白了，这就是新时代的\"电力革命\"。以前大家拼谁家发电厂大，现在拼的是谁家电网调度更智能。",
      "start": 326.75,
      "duration": 11.32,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比挺贴切。而且这事对创业公司来说是个特别积极的信号。不是说模型好就一定能赢，而是工程能力、架构设计、成本控制这些\"脏活累活\"反而成了核心竞争力。",
      "start": 338.549,
      "duration": 13.995,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，我突然想到一个事，你说这种跨云架构会不会以后变成行业标配？就像现在的微服务一样，大家都得上？",
      "start": 352.976,
      "duration": 10.58,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "早晚的事。而且你看，这件事背后还藏着一个更大的趋势——云厂商的议价权在被削弱。以前大家默认AWS、阿里云是唯一的选项，现在大家发现可以\"脚踏几条船\"，云厂商的定价空间就小了。",
      "start": 364.024,
      "duration": 17.957,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个对咱们普通用户有啥影响呀？",
      "start": 382.471,
      "duration": 2.743,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "间接影响很大。当AI产品成本降下来，它才有空间去做免费或者低价的功能给你用。你看现在很多AI应用开始敢推免费版了，背后就是这些成本优化的功劳。",
      "start": 385.691,
      "duration": 13.951,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "明白了，这叫\"看不见的福利\"。行，咱们快速过几条快讯。第一条，OpenAI花重金搞了个田园牧歌风的营销活动，结果画风太违和翻车了。",
      "start": 400.06,
      "duration": 17.129,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，我看到那条新闻差点没笑出来。他们是想学苹果那种生活方式广告，结果AI这东西天然就跟田园不搭，机器学习、神经网络这些东西跟牧歌放一起怎么想怎么别扭。",
      "start": 417.628,
      "duration": 13.255,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我理解他们的苦心，就是想让人工智能显得温暖一点、有人味一点嘛。但问题是OpenAI的公众形象一直是那种冷冰冰的极客范儿，突然走小清新路线，观众第一反应是\"这谁啊\"。",
      "start": 431.295,
      "duration": 17.454,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就是品牌定位和营销调性错位的典型案例。说白了，品牌不是你想立就能立的，是用户多年来用脚投票投出来的。强行扭转，往往适得其反。",
      "start": 449.242,
      "duration": 15.432,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "而且这次砸了不少钱吧？据说效果还适得其反，好感度反而下降了。我跟你说，公关这事儿有时候真不如不公关。",
      "start": 465.083,
      "duration": 12.06,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "同意。下一个，腾讯混元发了Hy ASR 3.0 preview，语音识别开始理解上下文了。",
      "start": 477.63,
      "duration": 7.793,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个有意思。以前的语音识别不就是把你说的话转成文字吗？理解上下文是啥意思？",
      "start": 485.865,
      "duration": 8.272,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，传统ASR是\"听一句转一句\"，遇到同音字、模糊发音就懵了。3.0 preview引入了语义理解，它能根据你前面说了什么、后文可能要说什么，去判断当前这个词最可能是哪个字。",
      "start": 494.597,
      "duration": 16.738,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "举个例子哈，我说\"今天天气真好，我想去……\"，后面可能接\"公园\"或者\"海边\"，它就能预判？",
      "start": 511.806,
      "duration": 8.403,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，就是这个意思。而且据说元宝App已经率先接入了，国内语音大模型开始迈入\"语义级\"时代。这事儿影响挺大的，你想啊，咱们打语音电话、开会录音、智能客服这些场景，以后都会更顺畅。",
      "start": 520.621,
      "duration": 18.392,
